      "sentenceRef": "Приехала на вокзал до десяти.",
      "explanation": "The preposition 'до' means 'before' or 'until' and always takes the genitive case. 'До десяти' = before ten. More examples: 'до обеда' (before lunch), 'до вечера' (until evening), 'до конца' (until the end). The opposite is 'после' (after), which also takes genitive: 'после десяти' (after ten).",
